{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MONEY GLITCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own online shop and sell products directly to your customers. Build your empire from the ground up: acquire equipment, set up production facilities, and expand your network.<br>But be careful \u2014 too much attention can be dangerous. Authorities, competitors, and unhappy customers can quickly become your biggest problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your business</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create production chains by hand \u2014 from sourcing raw materials to shipping finished goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up workstations, automate your processes, and optimize delivery times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft products of varying quality and discover new recipes and combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/cc8011b2e1fea77d67e196b385976ee1.poster.avif?t=1762191746\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/cc8011b2e1fea77d67e196b385976ee1.webm?t=1762191746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/cc8011b2e1fea77d67e196b385976ee1.mp4?t=1762191746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customer satisfaction matters</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to reviews, handle complaints, and improve your product quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver on time to earn positive feedback and boost your reputation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose whether to play fair \u2014 or profit through manipulation and deception</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore an open and digital world</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase properties \u2014 from a damp mushroom cave to a full-scale industrial factory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources locally or order them anonymously through the Darknet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a handcrafted Darknet system with shops, forums, and hidden markets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with shady users and uncover the risks and rewards of the underground web</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/b761730be41be4542cabdf611029b172.poster.avif?t=1762191746\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/b761730be41be4542cabdf611029b172.webm?t=1762191746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/extras/b761730be41be4542cabdf611029b172.mp4?t=1762191746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interactive <strong>package system</strong> \u2014 pack, label, and track your deliveries manually</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dynamic <strong>reputation and review system</strong> that shapes your public image</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully simulated <strong>economy</strong>, including fluctuating prices and changing demand</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a legitimate entrepreneur \u2014 or the shadow mogul of the digital underworld?<br><strong>Welcome to MONEY GLITCH.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2407530?t=1762191746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2407530?t=1762191746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/f6cf380be9e8ca059afd40a4466a3bff509a4fa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762191746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2407530/f6cf380be9e8ca059afd40a4466a3bff509a4fa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762191746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Guests can be attacked by cartoon monsters"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MONEY GLITCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own online shop and sell products directly to your customers. Build your empire from the ground up: acquire equipment, set up production facilities, and expand your network.<br>But be careful \u2014 too much attention can be dangerous. Authorities, competitors, and unhappy customers can quickly become your biggest problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your business</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create production chains by hand \u2014 from sourcing raw materials to shipping finished goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up workstations, automate your processes, and optimize delivery times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft products of varying quality and discover new recipes and combinations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo